ons reduce respectively to x=1, an identity, and 1=3. Only the third has no solutions."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186204601 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "941269e9-0740-5020-83b8-d3783a064799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439627} {:answer/id #uuid "426d3b17-760f-5c16-910a-40a0fdb0d383" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439628}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "426d3b17-760f-5c16-910a-40a0fdb0d383" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439628} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae6d1a22-2307-5644-a79c-07affb468969" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440171} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71c64668-ae98-56fe-a7b0-e742a1a8d4fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439629} {:answer/id #uuid "1367e85c-34df-5be9-b953-27af4e23e70d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439630}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71c64668-ae98-56fe-a7b0-e742a1a8d4fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439629} :answer-field/id #uuid "fba04f86-41f6-5550-b151-b65b1c7dd3e9" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440172} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c534d7da-f4a5-52db-985c-005806234e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439631} {:answer/id #uuid "1cbb827c-63da-5d04-86a6-0741028ae81c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439632}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c534d7da-f4a5-52db-985c-005806234e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439631} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b688529-71b7-5820-be58-67f74aaf4834" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440173}] :question/id #uuid "6bda3cab-2f65-5bfd-a054-8baee9c84dc6" :question/math-academy-id "q-288058" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $4x - 2 = 4x + 3$\n- **II.** $3x + 4 = 3x + 4$\n- **III.** $5x = 2x + 6$" :question/worked-solution "The equations reduce respectively to -2=3, an identity, and x=2. Only the first has no solutions."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297172 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "533b9094-d677-5376-88f4-8f426a2a4cf6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438046} {:answer/id #uuid "2b5a3d38-5a54-5a47-a0a8-64956fa7cdee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438047}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b5a3d38-5a54-5a47-a0a8-64956fa7cdee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438047} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd3eb9cd-0eda-53a6-bbc3-9f6bfbd15e06" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439052} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "38767ef4-49fe-519a-b838-3b77b5b7521b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438048} {:answer/id #uuid "36138474-e8c9-5d26-acfa-e3b7ef2f057d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438049}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "36138474-e8c9-5d26-acfa-e3b7ef2f057d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438049} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6d2fdbb-10bc-55e5-8c2c-6df645004975" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439053} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4435d623-199a-5d01-8347-ab72dc2191c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438050} {:answer/id #uuid "83476a1a-ee79-50fd-b7a1-580c8914eb50" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438051}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4435d623-199a-5d01-8347-ab72dc2191c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438050} :answer-field/id #uuid "5259194c-9195-582d-b7ec-c468a67fa9be" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439054}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1b892079-10a1-5d68-a34f-01695fac566e" :question/math-academy-id "q-288066" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $-3u+4=-3u-1$\n- **II.** $2u+5=2u+8$\n- **III.** $6u-2=3u+1$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3u+4 & =-3u-1 \\\\ -3u+4+3u & =-3u-1+3u \\\\ 4 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $u.$ Therefore, the equation $-3u+4=-3u-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2u+5 & =2u+8 \\\\ 2u+5-2u & =2u+8-2u \\\\ 5 & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $u.$ Therefore, the equation $2u+5=2u+8$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6u-2 & =3u+1 \\\\ 6u-2-3u+2 & =3u+1-3u+2 \\\\ 3u & =3 \\\\ u & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $6u-2=3u+1$ has the unique solution $u=1.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297173 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5bbb7117-6145-53ca-ad4c-bad31bb9f9af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438052} {:answer/id #uuid "671b6a92-35b3-597e-be0a-c9cb5b791a09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438053}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "671b6a92-35b3-597e-be0a-c9cb5b791a09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438053} :answer-field/id #uuid "27b44160-5603-5c9b-a638-902e6099883a" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439055} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4222c763-212d-511f-8fbd-f58190e2e759" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438054} {:answer/id #uuid "3f98701c-3dbf-5adb-90ef-8da0bf27f04a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438055}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3f98701c-3dbf-5adb-90ef-8da0bf27f04a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438055} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b686279-275d-59b3-9845-affb7909a340" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439056} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b38af36b-5c28-52cd-827f-5d2c79c4e02b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438056} {:answer/id #uuid "5c014ef5-df66-55a4-9f0c-a5b36748f66b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438057}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b38af36b-5c28-52cd-827f-5d2c79c4e02b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438056} :answer-field/id #uuid "61cc02af-d6dd-57ac-bd35-0666f970edb9" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439057}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9e1fdbd8-4927-548c-aafb-62f0ed007aa2" :question/math-academy-id "q-288070" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $-4y+2=-4y-5$\n- **II.** $6y+3=6y-1$\n- **III.** $5y-7=2y+1$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4y+2 & =-4y-5 \\\\ -4y+2+4y & =-4y-5+4y \\\\ 2 & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $-4y+2=-4y-5$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6y+3 & =6y-1 \\\\ 6y+3-6y & =6y-1-6y \\\\ 3 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $6y+3=6y-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5y-7 & =2y+1 \\\\ 5y-7-2y+7 & =2y+1-2y+7 \\\\ 3y & =8 \\\\ y & =\\frac{8}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $5y-7=2y+1$ has the unique solution $y=\\frac{8}{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297174 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b7fde21a-0d8d-594b-a745-db65189df67f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438058} {:answer/id #uuid "8ece53fa-2eb2-5b1c-b285-9b87f8f4daae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438059}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ece53fa-2eb2-5b1c-b285-9b87f8f4daae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438059} :answer-field/id #uuid "84307fe1-029d-5028-aa23-639aad6faaed" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439058} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d5cc2ff-b49f-5c4a-970f-cdbb15792abc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438060} {:answer/id #uuid "e7c10c6b-8ee7-5fa9-9d42-6f7cf79b8350" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438061}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0d5cc2ff-b49f-5c4a-970f-cdbb15792abc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438060} :answer-field/id #uuid "5867c7b6-4f6f-5a06-af87-9049cb497b9a" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439059} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee6986a4-2a71-509d-9e9c-688693540c97" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438062} {:answer/id #uuid "d69e090d-5eb5-5b4e-b8b4-4433ad55707e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438063}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee6986a4-2a71-509d-9e9c-688693540c97" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438062} :answer-field/id #uuid "5782e1ec-cdc2-5bee-a672-c727cc727606" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439060}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "22403a37-d9b4-5866-bee2-a28d9c27c3b3" :question/math-academy-id "q-288072" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $2z-4=2z+1$\n- **II.** $5z+6=5z+6$\n- **III.** $3z+2=z+4$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2z-4 & =2z+1 \\\\ 2z-4-2z & =2z+1-2z \\\\ -4 & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $z.$ Therefore, the equation $2z-4=2z+1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5z+6 & =5z+6 \\\\ 5z+6-5z & =5z+6-5z \\\\ 6 & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $z.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3z+2 & =z+4 \\\\ 3z+2-z-2 & =z+4-z-2 \\\\ 2z & =2 \\\\ z & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $3z+2=z+4$ has the unique solution $z=1.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297175 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "220ca104-2317-5355-b6f9-238d7b5e2da7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438064} {:answer/id #uuid "29bf254a-4e1b-5c2b-b3eb-48992ead8349" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438065}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "220ca104-2317-5355-b6f9-238d7b5e2da7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438064} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad481161-f390-54f8-b99c-f0b018cbf93d" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439061} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7b8b1efb-e712-53d2-a457-f8729510edfa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438066} {:answer/id #uuid "2a584f47-36b5-5f9e-a333-07b07506ccab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438067}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7b8b1efb-e712-53d2-a457-f8729510edfa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438066} :answer-field/id #uuid "20ba482c-6e9d-5a6e-a9d8-c815e493f55e" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439062} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8617b3bd-b969-56d6-b993-a80ccaf50cf4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438068} {:answer/id #uuid "5f78f8cc-2978-55d1-9b15-8c6c21d6c9be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438069}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5f78f8cc-2978-55d1-9b15-8c6c21d6c9be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438069} :answer-field/id #uuid "e00e8280-0c1c-5114-85aa-6e63beddc409" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439063}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ae9bca83-e68f-5756-9519-1447b4343c01" :question/math-academy-id "q-288073" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $3w+2=2w+2$\n- **II.** $4w-7=4w-7$\n- **III.** $6w+5=6w+9$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3w+2 & =2w+2 \\\\ 3w+2-2w-2 & =2w+2-2w-2 \\\\ w & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $3w+2=2w+2$ has the unique solution $w=0.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4w-7 & =4w-7 \\\\ 4w-7-4w & =4w-7-4w \\\\ -7 & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $w.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6w+5 & =6w+9 \\\\ 6w+5-6w & =6w+9-6w \\\\ 5 & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $w.$ Therefore, the equation $6w+5=6w+9$ has no solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297176 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "011e4d4e-2435-5fb2-8574-19c1dbaf09f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438070} {:answer/id #uuid "8f578d76-5649-5082-be77-dd1b0e5dcbac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438071}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "011e4d4e-2435-5fb2-8574-19c1dbaf09f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438070} :answer-field/id #uuid "94fbe475-e14d-5369-a8f5-50ea65227255" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439064} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb87e3b1-181c-58b9-a433-5f220bb4a2af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438072} {:answer/id #uuid "d8bb8bbe-2133-551e-8af1-914f9e44ca08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438073}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d8bb8bbe-2133-551e-8af1-914f9e44ca08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438073} :answer-field/id #uuid "29f521f2-17c5-5d89-845f-2032ff8443ed" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439065} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "39b56f35-4411-58e8-91b8-70740004bb8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438074} {:answer/id #uuid "855857a7-7338-5129-b4f4-752ae0f7d9dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438075}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39b56f35-4411-58e8-91b8-70740004bb8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438074} :answer-field/id #uuid "345c1cd0-794d-566a-9e4b-9b18bedff524" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439066}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6480ee2c-c900-5448-85b3-32f94538971e" :question/math-academy-id "q-288074" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $9v-5=4v+2$\n- **II.** $2v+3=2v+7$\n- **III.** $5v-1=5v-1$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9v-5 & =4v+2 \\\\ 9v-5-4v+5 & =4v+2-4v+5 \\\\ 5v & =7 \\\\ v & =\\frac{7}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $9v-5=4v+2$ has the unique solution $v=\\frac{7}{5}.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2v+3 & =2v+7 \\\\ 2v+3-2v & =2v+7-2v \\\\ 3 & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $v.$ Therefore, the equation $2v+3=2v+7$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5v-1 & =5v-1 \\\\ 5v-1-5v & =5v-1-5v \\\\ -1 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $v.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation With No Solutions"}]}
